  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict prevention and community resilience for peace in Barh El gazal in Chad.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project, which has a duration of 24 months, aims to contribute to the consolidation of peace through the establishment of multi - stakeholder governance mechanisms allowing a peaceful and sustainable management of agrosylvo pastoral resources in order to strengthen social cohesion in the province of Barh El Gazal (BEG).</narrative>
  </description>
